chezmoi dots edit — Edit dotfiles source (default command)

USAGE
  chezmoi dots [edit] [<what>]

ARGUMENTS
  what  Registry entry, source path or target path (default: interactive picker).

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).
  EDITOR / VISUAL  editor selection: EDITOR, then VISUAL, then vi (notepad on Windows).
  TMUX / WT_SESSION  enable the live preview pane when the terminal supports it.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots
  chezmoi dots edit shell
  chezmoi dots dot_config/git/config.tmpl
